{"packId":"mushroom-safety","packName":"Mushroom Safety","version":"1.1","embeddingModel":"all-MiniLM-L6-v2","embeddingModelVersion":"all-MiniLM-L6-v2-r5","sourceType":"core","chunks":[{"chunkId":"mushroom-safety-can-ash-tell-me-if-a-wild-mushroom-is-edible-fro-0","text":"#### Can Ash tell me if a wild mushroom is edible from a photo?\n\nNo. A photo can help describe visible features, but it is not enough to confirm that a wild mushroom is safe to eat. Treat unknown wild mushrooms as unsafe until a qualified local mushroom expert identifies the actual specimen.\n\nDo not eat the mushroom based on an app, a field guide match, a single photo, taste, smell, color, or a computer vision suggestion. Many poisonous mushrooms resemble edible species.","source":"mushroom-safety","sectionPath":"Mushroom Safety > Edibility","sourceType":"core","embeddingModelVersion":"all-MiniLM-L6-v2-r5","embedding":[0.092746,0.047694,0.019978,0.036515,0.051855,-0.029431,0.042993,-0.014923,-0.030872,0.010119,0.068819,-0.030368,-0.016741,0.050695,-0.01504,-0.046145,0.073384,0.005867,-0.027746,0.092347,0.028035,0.06481,-0.017823,-0.035864,0.05311,-0.023342,0.019121,0.005295,-0.019863,-0.100082,0.010882,-0.001157,-0.015703,-0.016216,-0.007259,-0.0216,-0.029343,-0.045551,0.080759,0.012164,-0.015396,-0.02887,0.050001,-0.03961,-0.04683,-0.008988,-0.090093,-0.065373,0.020365,-0.003265,-0.014962,-0.085651,-0.033029,0.000603,0.036663,-0.053449,0.018463,-0.07556,0.02147,0.065638,0.011727,-0.02292,-0.027093,-0.010642,0.01815,0.030392,-0.036927,-0.082766,0.039185,-0.13813,-0.022465,0.039443,0.010715,-0.012706,-0.078482,0.043531,-0.02428,-0.014292,-0.017949,0.00075,-0.036153,0.054433,-0.009959,-0.024159,0.087808,0.077975,-0.045533,0.008584,-0.078206,0.017466,0.014954,0.099815,-0.028318,0.021408,-0.075704,0.010156,0.089383,-0.025649,-0.05668,-0.031926,0.017424,0.015084,-0.027578,-0.091792,-0.015325,-0.049473,-0.024966,-0.0275,0.072395,-0.014346,-0.029887,0.009807,0.052473,-0.0164,-0.025967,-0.090555,0.0500