folds\n- Full stem from top to base\n- Base dug up intact, including any cup, bulb, or volva\n- Ring, veil remnants, bruising, latex, or color changes\n- Multiple specimens at different ages, if present\n- Habitat, nearby trees, substrate, location, and date\n\nOne top-down photo is usually not enough.","source":"mushroom-safety","sectionPath":"Mushroom Safety > Documentation","sourceType":"core","embeddingModelVersion":"all-MiniLM-L6-v2-r5","embedding":[0.037764,0.07149,-0.004025,-0.018638,0.035251,-0.034257,-0.016492,0.005368,0.011206,-0.041646,0.058017,-0.0902,-0.011704,0.091468,-0.105343,-0.012445,0.013945,0.047019,0.012233,-0.030026,-0.044807,0.01628,0.057697,-0.010861,0.013201,-0.005144,0.010545,0.025382,-0.043608,-0.17085,-0.034343,-0.002384,0.020313,0.015878,0.020064,0.023633,0.035154,0.04665,0.076049,0.013154,0.008262,-0.046604,0.082357,0.024142,0.00054,0.048064,-0.072373,-0.00966,0.056756,-0.015566,-0.070819,-0.124656,-0.048056,0.088905,0.030544,0.020843,0.00187,-0.044602,0.07621,0.045695,-0.011961,0.002193,-0.041897,0.013172,0.021417,0.068892,0.003937,-0.091872,0.016942,-0.087761,-0.006862,0.06475,0.009611,0.009379,-0.040526,-0.023508,-0.054811,-0.007506,-0.030812,-0.026172,-0.020142,0.121241,-0.027769,0.010409,0.074415,0.050031,-0.052325,0.006925,-0.114726,-0.016644,0.002133,0.05618,-0.07449,-0.036579,-0.055355,0.034042,0.059555,-0.048273,0.007567,-0.013003,0.0595,-0.048544,0.050176,-0.026881,0.003839,-0.057348,-0.007588,0.013302,0.132247,-0.041644,-0.016856,0.013944,-0.064099,-0.048767,0.021064,-0.084569,0.053555,0.007195,-0.037643,-0.135645,-0.033401,0.000783,0.020002,-0.069519,0.036568,0.018652,-0.149158,-0.0,0.092835,-0.023122,0.02027,0.074921,0.107308,-0.038786,-0.041136,-0.041858,-0.065873,0.021597,-0.088409,-0.003456,-0.123071,0.046323,0.086076,0.037805,-0.048269,0.040914,-0.078068,0.020443,-0.050581,-0.011138,0.022776,0.029146,0.031662,0.019134,0.023988,-0.062329,0.009524,-0.001249,0.046234,0.042629,-0.065671,0.019193,0.023176,0.018959,0.024831,-